OL,4,CBaker thought Call of Duty cake call   
OL,5,Cwas a prank                            
OL,6,GWhen a cake maker received a call from 
OL,7,GCalifornia asking if she could make a  
OL,8,Gcake to mark the 20th anniversary of   
OL,9,Gthe Call of Duty video game, she       
OL,10,Gthought it was a joke.                 
OL,12,FBut it proved to be a genuine call     
OL,13,Ffrom the tech firm Activision, and     
OL,14,Fsince then her cakes have become more  
OL,15,Fand more popular in the gaming world.  
OL,17,FThe American company went on to order  
OL,18,Fanother similar cake to mark the       
OL,19,Frelease of a new version of the Call   
OL,20,Fof Duty game, and this week an IT firm 
OL,21,Fordered a cake to celebrate the launch 
OL,22,Fof Grand Theft Auto 6.            G3/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
